{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hongshui River is the upstream of Xijiang River, the main stream of the Pearl River Basin in China. Named after flowing through the red sandstone layer and the reddish brown color of the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game starts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'start game', the image will be grayed out, and the colored parts will be randomly scrambled into 16 small fragments, scattered randomly on the screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on the small image, drag it to its original position to restore it, until all the small images move to the correct position, and the game ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End or start the next game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the small fragments move to the correct position, and the game ends. At this point, click &quot;try again&quot; to repeat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109900?t=1760749901","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109900?t=1760749901","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109900/1204eb6ccc7f743b81cc6f8c82fc41b9794305c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760749901","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109900/1204eb6ccc7f743b81cc6f8c82fc41b9794305c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760749901","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hongshui River is the upstream of Xijiang River, the main stream of the Pearl River Basin in China. Named 